            <div class="jc-card-desc">
              <ul class="jc-bullet-list">
                <li>Soak in warm soapy water for 5–10 minutes.</li>
                <li>Gently scrub with a soft baby toothbrush and pat dry with a lint-free microfibre cloth.</li>
              </ul>
              <h3 class="jc-subheading">Gemstone Jewellery</h3>
              <ul class="jc-bullet-list">
